---
description: Core project rules for ClinicBoost SMS
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `CLAUDE.md` at the repo root for full context before writing code.

Stack is fixed: Next.js App Router + TypeScript, Postgres 16, Drizzle, pg-boss,
Docker Compose, Caddy. Do not introduce Redis, a vector database, embeddings,
or additional services. The production server is 4GB RAM with 8.7GB disk.

Build in vertical slices that run end to end, not in horizontal layers.

Prefer boring, legible code. This is handed over to a non-technical owner who
may bring in another developer later.

Out of scope, do not build: self-serve clinic signup, billing, reseller portal,
missed-call text-back.
